<Defs>

	<ThingDef ParentName="DrugImplantThingMakeableBase">
		<defName>DI_LastWishImplant</defName>
		<label>drug-implant (Last Wish)</label>
		<description>An implant, programmed to contain and automate the usage of Last-Wish. There is no need for adaptation, as the implant itself simply contains the dangerous drug for easy application, rather than actively affecting the mind.

The user can consciously activate the implant with a minor amount of effort, releasing the drug and imparting to themselves the strength they may need. They can also store a limited amount of Mecha Suppressors to prolong the inevitable.

Those that dance with the devil may find themselves emboldened…</description>
		<descriptionHyperlinks>
			<RecipeDef>InstallDI_LastWishImplant</RecipeDef>
		</descriptionHyperlinks>
		<techLevel>Spacer</techLevel>
		<graphicData>
			<texPath>Things/Item/Health/HealthItem</texPath>
			<graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
			<drawSize>0.80</drawSize>
			<color>(189,169,118)</color>
		</graphicData>
		<statBases>
			<MarketValue>400</MarketValue>
		</statBases>
		<costList>
			<USH_LastWish>1</USH_LastWish>
			<DI_BaseImplantPart>1</DI_BaseImplantPart>
		</costList>
		<recipeMaker>
			<recipeUsers Inherit="False">
				<li>DrugLab</li>
			</recipeUsers>
			<researchPrerequisite>LastWishRes</researchPrerequisite>
		</recipeMaker>
		<thingCategories>
			<li>BodyParts</li>
		</thingCategories>
	</ThingDef>
	
	<AbilityDef ParentName="AbilityTouchBase">
        <defName>DI_LastWishImplantSuppresorsConsume</defName>
        <label>consume Suppressors</label>
        <description>Consume Mecha Suppressors to store them within the implant. They will automatically be used at the optimal time to provide the maximum amount of time for the user when they use Last Wish. Up to 7 can be stored up; this ability cannot be used once Last Wish has been activated.</description>
        <iconPath>Things/Item/Drugs/ScarletSupportPills</iconPath>
        <cooldownTicksRange>0</cooldownTicksRange>
        <showPsycastEffects>false</showPsycastEffects>
        <displayGizmoWhileUndrafted>true</displayGizmoWhileUndrafted>
        <verbProperties>
            <verbClass>Verb_CastAbility</verbClass>
            <drawAimPie>true</drawAimPie>
            <warmupTime>1</warmupTime>
            <range>-1</range>
            <targetParams>
                <canTargetSelf>false</canTargetSelf>
                <canTargetBuildings>false</canTargetBuildings>
                <canTargetPawns>false</canTargetPawns>
                <canTargetItems>true</canTargetItems>
                <thingCategory>Item</thingCategory>
                <mapObjectTargetsMustBeAutoAttackable>false</mapObjectTargetsMustBeAutoAttackable>
            </targetParams>
        </verbProperties>
        <comps>
            <li Class="DrugImplantLuciferiumExpansion.CompProperties_PickUpItem" />
        </comps>
    </AbilityDef>
	
	<HediffDef ParentName="ImplantHediffBase">
		<defName>DI_LastWishImplant</defName>
		<label>d-implant (Last Wish)</label>
		<description>An implant, programmed to contain and automate the usage of Last-Wish. There is no need for adaptation, as the implant itself simply contains the dangerous drug for easy application, rather than actively affecting the mind.

The user can consciously activate the implant with a minor amount of effort, releasing the drug and imparting to themselves the strength they may need. They can also store a limited amount of Mecha Suppressors to prolong the inevitable.

Those that dance with the devil may find themselves emboldened…</description>
